17,"review":"Hersey harıkaydı teşekkürler","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:06.000000Z"},{"id":5193451,"review":"The place was amazing and just as described by Xuru Stays , I would love to come back again one day!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z"},{"id":5199113,"review":"The place was very clean, spacious, and 10 mins away from everything","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z"},{"id":5217111,"review":"Verygood","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5232497,"review":"Xuru is always a good idea","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5237657,"review":"It was a nice stay. :) \nThe apartment needed to be reviewed before our check-in, as there was some dust, juice stains & hair on the furniture probably from previous tenants. \nWifi/password provided were incorrect. \nNeed some maintenance regarding the toilet, fridge, wardrobes, tables and kitchen utensils. \nIt would have been great to see our host at check-in/check-out.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5240589,"review":"My revie would be: \nCool stuff\nVery nice view of the sea from bedrooms, really great.\n300 meters - 6 mins walk to the beach\nAmazing view from both bedrooms to the Mangroovy trees and the sea. \n\nSpace for improvement: \nThe apartment is older than photos, can use a face lift as furniture is old and used\nFurniture , doors, toilets can use some renovation\nAll containers for  shower gel / hand soap were empty or contains cream not soap \nRunning water in the flush of the second room toilet, needs repair \nLight bulb / spot light needs replacement \nEn Suite bathroom no hot water\nThe pans in the kitchen are overused, Teefal layer is removed, not safe to use \nWiFi the network advised by host is not available","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5249608,"review":"We loved it","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5264768,"review":"Amazing place, loved it!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5270771,"review":"great place 👌","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5276683,"review":"J’ai vraiment adoré mon séjour à cet endroit ! L’appartement était très beau ! La piscine est parfaite et l’endroit est stratégique, en bas du condo on retrouve un restaurant très réputé qui se spécialise dans la cuisine égyptienne, il y a également une supérette et un magasin qui vend de la crème glacée et du café style starbucks. Xuru sont très actifs et ont répondu très rapidement à toutes mes préoccupations","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5291085,"review":"The place was fantastic—very clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. It was a great place to stay, and we thoroughly enjoyed our time there. Thank you for your excellent hospitality!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5302317,"review":"Great stay, and awesome host very supportive and responsive, would definitely come again, thanks.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5316448,"review":"Super responsive host, a great location and a very cosy apartment!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5324889,"review":"Real value of money \r\nVery nice place","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5337784,"review":"The host requested the guests’ IDs to issue the barcodes used to enter el gouna, the host confirmed receiving the 6 IDs but I was surprised one day before the check in date that the host has sent me barcode for 5 guests only not 6 claiming that he didn’t even receive the sixth ID then claimed that the ID was not clear so I sent them a clearer copy and the host promised to send me the barcode by the next morning. I was surprised at the Gouna gates that the host didn’t issue the barcode or send me anything and had to park in the sun (temp. above 40) to text the host.\n\nThe host confirmed that the apartment has cooking basics in the amenities, but when we arrived he said that these items are unavailable and you can buy them from the supermarket in a rude manner.\n\nThe host also confirmed that the apartment has enough towels & blankets for 6 guests but only provided 4 towels and didn’t send the extra 2 towels until the end of the second day. Also one guest slept without a blanket for a night","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5341445,"review":"Great stay and location!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5346959,"review":"Enjoyed our stay so much definitely coming backk!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5358073,"review":"excellent","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5373926,"review":"lovely unit clean,modern and worth it","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5414841,"review":"we enjoyed our stay","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5423625,"review":"Nur 10 Minuten zu Fuss zu KBC.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:44.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:44.000000Z"},{"id":5431859,"review":"I had a fantastic experience with Xurustays. \nTheir professionalism and attention to detail made my stay seamless and enjoyable. \n\nA special thanks to the support team for being incredibly responsive and helpful throughout. \n\nHighly recommend.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5498652,"review":"Great flat, perfect location very responsive hosts ! Thank you !","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5565201,"review":"It was wonderful experience. I like to book my apartment for my vacation in El Gouna every year with them. They have all the time the same wonderful service. I can recommend them further.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5603649,"review":"Excellent experience and the management, thank you, was very helpful.\nI hope he continues with this excellent performance.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5603942,"review":"A great apartment, clean with all facilities to make a comfortable and relaxed stay.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5616309,"review":"وحدة رائعة وإطلاله خلابه، الموقع جميل وقريب من كل شيء \nالبيت هادئ وفيه جميع الاحتياجات \nحصلت مشكله بسيطه وكان الاستجابه والحل سريع\nسأعيد التجربه بكل تأكيد","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5625318,"review":"Great location with a lovely view! Everything was close by, which made exploring super convenient. The host was very friendly and responded quickly to any questions. The place was clean and looked just like the photos. Would definitely recommend!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5639136,"review":"Everything was just perfect! Thank you Xuru stays🙏🏻","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5658246,"review":"Excellent rapport qualité prix. Très bonne localisation, piscine très agréable et immense ! \nL’appartement est bien rangé les lits sont confortables. \nJe recommande","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5715805,"review":"excellent séjour dans cet appartement, un appartement qui vaut 5 étoiles sur tous les niveaux, propreté , emplacement , linge de lit, ...\nXurus est une agence professionnelle, réactif , a l écoute , ....\nMerci Xurus , le prochain sejour ça ne sera qu avec vous","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5746493,"review":"The apartment is nice and clean, and they respond quickly. If there’s any issue, they fix it right away. The location is great, and everything is nearby.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5778554,"review":"Family Vacation 🤍","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5785299,"review":"My husband and I had a wonderful time staying at the apartment for a couple night during our honeymoon. Xuru was super responsive and helpful with everything I asked. The place was so nice super spacious great light lovely balcony big kitchen super comfy bed. Would definitely recommend!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5792365,"review":"me and my family had a nice holiday, the place was great and everything was nice 🙂, i recommend Xuru stay's","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5808502,"review":"Great place and location!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5841209,"review":"I had an amazing stay! The place was spotless, beautifully decorated, and had everything I needed for a comfortable visit. The location was perfect — close to everything but still quiet and relaxing. The host was incredibly kind, responsive, and made me feel very welcome from the start. I would absolutely recommend this Airbnb to anyone visiting the area and would love to stay here again next time!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5914862,"review":"Everything was perfect, great apartment and great location. Really enjoyed my stay","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":6004392,"review":"Great location. Great communication- very responsive but unfortunately the flat was very dusty when we arrived. They probably would have cleaned it if i asked but didnt have time to wait with a baby. They were happy to change bed sheets mid way through stay- cant fault communication team. The flat was good but kitchen was empty, barely any usable pots pans etc to cook with which meant we had to eat out a-lot. Sofa felt dirty- some stains but just felt like it needed a deep clean.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6076258,"review":"Amazing","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6095611,"review":"Great location and stay, the host is very helpful and replies very fast","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6103549,"review":"Loved everything about our stay. Highly recommend booking it for your stay in Gouna. We really enjoyed the rooftop!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6117469,"review":"………","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6130731,"review":"Great stay","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6148181,"review":"Clean place and responsive host. We really enjoyed our stay!","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6166525,"review":"Great stay at Mangroovy! The place was clean, comfortable, and perfect for a relaxing getaway. The owner was very friendly, responsive, and helpful throughout our stay. We had a lovely experience and would definitely recommend it.","rental_id":205911,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}